{"id":"wb-8-267","name":"洑溪徐氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"洑溪徐氏宗祠","text":"洑溪徐氏宗祠也称徐大宗祠、徐太师家庙，位于中华人民共和国江苏省无锡市宜兴市宜城街道溪隐路200号（原洑溪河畔溪隐村，今溪隐府小区内），为明代徐溥的家族祠堂，建于明弘治三年（1490），现有五进，其中第二进过厅和第三进正厅为原物，面阔均为三间，硬山顶。正厅梁柱均采用楠木，又称楠木花厅，其室内梁柱枋檩上均存有色泽鲜艳的彩画，如缠枝花卉、包袱锦和云鹤等图案，属典型的苏式彩画。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B4%91%E6%BA%AA%E5%BE%90%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":94069237,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94069237","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cdad4b176f150ed2b0384f90.jpg","title":"The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Xu_in_Xiyin_Village_07_2026-05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Xu_in_Xiyin_Village_07_2026-05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/The_Memorial_Temple_for_the_Family_of_Xu_in_Xiyin_Village_07_2026-05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宜兴洑溪徐氏宗祠，大门南面。","width":320,"height":213}}